{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114710","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114710","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1511471001:0":{"text":"いやあ、さすがだな！お前さんならきっと、猟血祭で勝利できると思ってたよ！","source_cn":"那非！好孩子，我就知道你一定能赢得猎血节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF940F66327EEF674","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511471002:0":{"text":"それで、ダンヌは……やっぱり……","source_cn":"顿……他战死了，是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E7A04AAD057570A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511471003:0":{"text":"……すまない。","source_cn":"……对不起。<key:dialog478>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F6EB2CC5CCEC25D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511471004:0":{"text":"お前さんのせいじゃないさ。猟血祭はそういうもんだ……","source_cn":"不是你的错……猎血节原本就很残酷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x594743FD674E7DA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511471005:0":{"text":"前回の猟血祭なんて、勝者すら現れず、参加者は全員死んだんだ……","source_cn":"还记得上一次猎血节，所有参加的战士都战死了，连最后的胜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3870BABC081C18C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511471006:0":{"text":"お前さんが生きて戻って、ヤクボルの勇士になれただけでも、十分喜ばしいことだよ。きっと、ダンヌもそう思っているはずさ。","source_cn":"你能活着回来，成为雅库伯尔的勇士，雅库伯尔人人都很高兴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52DE32FA6565D5C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511471007:0":{"text":"……けど、おれは喜べない。","source_cn":"……但我不高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9A43C57286EA8B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511471008:0":{"text":"ダンヌは……<style=\"highlight\">狩猟神に殺されたんだ</style>。","source_cn":"顿，<style=highlight>他是被狩猎神杀死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD4773E349E76378","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511471009:0":{"text":"な、なんだって……？","source_cn":"你、你说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9870AF90E39E7C95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511471010:0":{"text":"おれとダンヌは、最後まで生き残った。そしたら、狩猟神が現れて、自分に挑めと言ってきたんだ。","source_cn":"顿和我一起坚持到了最后。狩猎神降临在我们面前，让我们挑战她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A6AF27D8093A2E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511471011:0":{"text":"ダンヌは神に挑んだ……そして、殺された。","source_cn":"顿照做了……